# @fabric/core has no git dependencies. Keep npm 12+ default allow-git=none
# (do not set allow-git=all here). That default blocks install-time RCE via a
# git dependency’s .npmrc overriding the git binary, even under --ignore-scripts.
#
# Downstream packages that install Fabric from GitHub (Hub, @fabric/http, apps)
# may set allow-git=all in *their* .npmrc for nested commit-SHA git fetches.
